---
layout: base.njk
title: "Contact | VidhiCorp Legal Chambers"
description: "Get in touch with VidhiCorp Legal Chambers. Gurugram office, phone, email and WhatsApp: a member of the chambers responds within one business day."
permalink: /contact/
pageSchema:
  "@context": "https://schema.org"
  "@type": "FAQPage"
  mainEntity:
    - "@type": "Question"
      name: "Does VidhiCorp Legal Chambers handle disputes as well as advisory work?"
      acceptedAnswer:
        "@type": "Answer"
        text: "Yes. While the chambers is built around preventive, advisory work, our partners also run pre-litigation strategy, arbitration and commercial litigation when a matter cannot be resolved without it."
    - "@type": "Question"
      name: "Which cities does VidhiCorp Legal Chambers serve?"
      acceptedAnswer:
        "@type": "Answer"
        text: "The chambers is based in Gurugram and advises clients across Delhi NCR, Mumbai and India through a network of associate counsel in other cities, engaged as specific matters require."
    - "@type": "Question"
      name: "How do I engage the firm for a new matter?"
      acceptedAnswer:
        "@type": "Answer"
        text: "Send an enquiry through the contact form, by email or by phone. A partner will review the matter and respond within one business day with next steps."
    - "@type": "Question"
      name: "Is an initial conversation chargeable?"
      acceptedAnswer:
        "@type": "Answer"
        text: "The initial conversation to understand your matter and confirm whether it falls within our practice areas is not chargeable."
---
<section class="page-hero has-photo grain">
  <div class="ph-photo"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1450101499163-c8848c66ca85?w=1400&q=55&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="" width="1400" height="933" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; Contact</p>
    <h1>Get in touch</h1>
    <p>Tell us briefly what you're facing. A partner reviews every enquiry personally and responds within one business day.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="two-col" style="align-items:flex-start">

      <div class="reveal">
        <form id="enquiry-form" novalidate action="https://formspree.io/f/xyeypwkd" method="POST" data-ajax data-success-message="Thank you. Your enquiry has been received, and a member of the chambers will respond within one business day.">
          <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New enquiry — VidhiCorp website">
          <div class="form-grid">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="name">Full name *</label>
              <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required autocomplete="name">
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="company">Company / Organisation</label>
              <input type="text" id="company" name="company" autocomplete="organization">
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="email">Email address *</label>
              <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email">
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="phone">Phone number *</label>
              <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" required autocomplete="tel">
            </div>
            <div class="field full">
              <label for="area">Practice area</label>
              <select id="area" name="area">
                <option value="">Select the closest fit (optional)</option>
                {% for pa in practiceAreas %}<option>{{ pa.name }}</option>{% endfor %}
                <option>Not sure yet</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div class="field full">
              <label for="message">Briefly describe your matter *</label>
              <textarea id="message" name="message" required placeholder="A few sentences is enough to start. We'll ask for detail once we understand the shape of it."></textarea>
            </div>
            <div class="field full">
              <label class="consent"><input type="checkbox" required> I confirm I am seeking this information at my own request, in accordance with the Bar Council of India's Rules on advertising by advocates.</label>
            </div>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary mt-24">Make an Enquiry</button>
          <div class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
        </form>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal">
        {% for office in offices %}
        <div style="background:var(--ink-950);color:var(--paper-50);padding:44px;border-radius:var(--radius-m){% if not loop.last %};margin-bottom:24px{% endif %}">
          <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--brass-300)">{{ office.name }}</p>
          <address style="font-style:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--ink-200)">
            {% for line in office.addressLines %}{{ line }}<br>{% endfor %}
          </address>
          <hr style="border:0;border-top:1px solid rgba(247,242,232,.14);margin:28px 0">
          <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;font-size:15px">
            {% for p in site.phones %}
            <a href="tel:{{ p.href }}" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:var(--paper-100)"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--brass-400)" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.362 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.338 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/></svg>{{ p.number }}</a>
            {% endfor %}
            {% for e in site.emails %}
            <a href="mailto:{{ e }}" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:var(--paper-100)"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--brass-400)" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 4h16v16H4z" opacity="0"/><path d="M22 6l-10 7L2 6"/><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/></svg>{{ e }}</a>
            {% endfor %}
            <a href="{{ site.social.whatsapp }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:var(--paper-100)"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="var(--brass-400)"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 0 0-8.6 15.1L2 22l5-1.4A10 10 0 1 0 12 2zm0 18a8 8 0 0 1-4.1-1.1l-.3-.2-3 .8.8-2.9-.2-.3A8 8 0 1 1 12 20z"/></svg>Message on WhatsApp</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-24" style="border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-m);overflow:hidden">
          <iframe
            title="VidhiCorp Legal Chambers — {{ office.name }} location"
            src="https://www.google.com/maps?q={{ office.mapQuery | urlencode }}&output=embed"
            width="100%" height="260" style="border:0;display:block" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade">
          </iframe>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}

        <p class="mt-24" style="font-size:13.5px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.75">Office Hours: {{ site.officeHours }}. Enquiries received outside these hours are reviewed the next business day.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ CLIENT / NEW MATTER INTAKE FORM ============ -->
<section class="section bg-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Already a client, or ready to engage?</p>
        <h2>New matter intake</h2>
        <p>For clients ready to formally open a matter, or existing clients raising a new one, this gives the chambers what's needed to assign the right partner immediately.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal" style="max-width:820px">
      <form id="intake-form" novalidate action="https://formspree.io/f/xyeypwkd" method="POST" data-ajax data-success-message="Thank you. Your matter has been logged and a partner will be in touch to confirm next steps.">
        <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New matter intake — VidhiCorp website">
        <div class="form-grid">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="i-name">Full name *</label>
            <input type="text" id="i-name" name="name" required autocomplete="name">
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="i-company">Company / Organisation *</label>
            <input type="text" id="i-company" name="company" required autocomplete="organization">
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="i-email">Email address *</label>
            <input type="email" id="i-email" name="email" required autocomplete="email">
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="i-phone">Phone number *</label>
            <input type="tel" id="i-phone" name="phone" required autocomplete="tel">
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="i-status">Are you an existing client? *</label>
            <select id="i-status" name="client_status" required>
              <option value="">Select one</option>
              <option>Existing client</option>
              <option>New client</option>
              <option>Referred by an existing client</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="i-urgency">Urgency</label>
            <select id="i-urgency" name="urgency">
              <option value="">Select the closest fit (optional)</option>
              <option>Routine — no fixed deadline</option>
              <option>Time-sensitive — action needed within weeks</option>
              <option>Urgent — action needed within days</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="field full">
            <label for="i-matter">Matter summary *</label>
            <textarea id="i-matter" name="matter_summary" required placeholder="What the matter involves, and any key dates or deadlines already known."></textarea>
          </div>
          <div class="field full">
            <label class="consent"><input type="checkbox" required> I confirm I am seeking this information at my own request, in accordance with the Bar Council of India's Rules on advertising by advocates.</label>
          </div>
        </div>
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary mt-24">Submit Matter</button>
        <div class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Before you write in</p>
        <h2>A few common questions</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="rows reveal-stagger">
      <div class="row-item" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1.4fr">
        <h4 style="font-size:18px">Does the chambers handle disputes as well as advisory work?</h4>
        <p>Yes. While we're built around preventive, advisory work, our partners also run pre-litigation strategy, arbitration and commercial litigation when a matter can't be resolved without it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="row-item" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1.4fr">
        <h4 style="font-size:18px">Which cities do you serve?</h4>
        <p>We're based in Gurugram and advise clients across Delhi NCR, Mumbai and India through a network of associate counsel in other cities, engaged as specific matters require.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="row-item" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1.4fr">
        <h4 style="font-size:18px">How do I engage the firm for a new matter?</h4>
        <p>Send an enquiry through the form above, by email or by phone. A partner reviews it personally and responds within one business day.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="row-item" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1.4fr;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)">
        <h4 style="font-size:18px">Is the initial conversation chargeable?</h4>
        <p>No. The initial conversation to understand your matter and confirm it's within our practice areas is not chargeable.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
